WEBVTT

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:09.460
Bring a JasperReports project over as a folder of JRXML sources.

00:00:15.535 --> 00:00:19.778
Open the folder importer and choose the parent report and its header subreport.

00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:29.273
Open Reports converts the files into editable drafts and links recognized child reports.

00:00:36.599 --> 00:00:41.575
Review the migration note for features that need attention before using the converted report.
